                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text ieHaVHVxqdg7sE8ZH"><p>As you inhale through the Lio device, air passes through the scent cartridge and delivers natural aromatics to your olfactory system. This process provides the hand-to-mouth ritual many people seek, encourages deep, calming breaths, engages your sense of smell, and delivers immediate sensory satisfaction without substances, all while you&apos;re breathing nothing but clean air infused with natural plant aromatics. A sensory experience designed to feel natural and satisfying.</p></div></div
