                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iaOKpxinLovA6QOws"><p>How the Cores Work</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iLwZb3EehlvKMnb9Y"><p>The heart of the Lio system is the Flavour Core. Each Core contains natural essential oils and plant extracts held in a premium-quality fiber matrix. As you inhale, air flows through the Core and over the aromatics, picking up natural scent that engages your olfactory system, providing sensory satisfaction while you work on changing behavioral patterns.</p></div></div
