                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text iIHLsfmC0iCXKv6br"><p>What&apos;s in the Cores?</p></div
                ><div data-instant-type="text" class="instant-rich-text i4HgiZu00GB2I3V2v"><p>Our scent cores are made using 100% organic natural essential oils extracted from plants, herbs, and botanicals. These premium-grade aromatics are produced by certified manufacturers within the EU, extracted from natural ingredients only, like peppermint, black pepper, cinnamon, and botanical aromas. In our Netherlands laboratory, our team blends science and aromatherapy to create sophisticated, natural formulations. No chemicals, no nicotine, no harmful additives, just natural plant extracts, expertly crafted for those seeking to change their habits.</p></div></div
